u should just give in? Surrender yourself to emotions and animal instincts! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Withdrawal</strong>: a faithful companion of any drug addict. Its presence becomes more tangible with every passing hour, until it overshadows every aspect of your life, inevitably taking down all other stats.</p></li></ul>",
